# Draft: kk: enable fast math for shaders
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/42580 state=closed
# ### What does this MR do and why?
<!-- Describe in detail what your merge request does and why. -->

AI was used for the commit messages and code comments.

Enables fast math for shader compilation as the default. TODO: Handle float controls

This brings GPU execution to a similar level as MoltenVK. We still have considerable improvements to do, so there's more to squeeze. Main bottleneck seems to be CPU now.

In draft until the common code changes' MR goes in
